    <bpmn:process id="W_W271" name="W271. Data Subject Access &amp; Deletion Requests (DPA Compliance)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer or employee formally requests access to or deletion of their personal data.
Frequency: Low (few per month)
Volume: 1 per request
Owner: Data Protection Officer (DPO)
Participants: Customer Service, IT Data Custodians, Legal
Source: workflow W271 — Data Subject Access &amp; Deletion Requests (DPA Compliance)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W271_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W271_Lane1" name="Customer Service Rep">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W271_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W271_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W271_Lane2" name="Data Protection Officer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W271_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W271_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W271_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W271_Lane3" name="IT Admin">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W271_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W271_End11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W271_Start5" name="Customer or employee formally requests access to or deletion of their personal data.">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W271_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W271_Task6" name="Customer submits a formal DSR (Data Subject Request) via portal or email.">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Customer submits a formal DSR (Data Subject Request) via portal or email.
Responsible (R): Customer Service Rep
Accountable (A): Data Protection Officer (DPO)
Duration: 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W271_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W271_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W271_Task7" name="DPO verifies the identity of the requester using government-issued ID or…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: DPO verifies the identity of the requester using government-issued ID or verified email/loyalty account.
Responsible (R): Data Protection Officer (DPO)
Accountable (A): Legal Counsel
Duration: 1 day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W271_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W271_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W271_Task8" name="DPO routes the request to IT for data extraction or anonymization; logs request…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: DPO routes the request to IT for data extraction or anonymization; logs request in DSAR tracker with deadline.
Responsible (R): Data Protection Officer (DPO)
Accountable (A): IT Admin
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W271_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W271_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W271_Task9" name="IT executes the right to be forgotten (anonymizing PII in ERP/CRM while keeping…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: IT executes the right to be forgotten (anonymizing PII in ERP/CRM while keeping transactional data for BIR compliance).
Responsible (R): IT Admin
Accountable (A): Data Protection Officer (DPO)
Duration: 1–3 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W271_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W271_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W271_Task10" name="DPO formally replies to the customer with a certificate of compliance within 30…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: DPO formally replies to the customer with a certificate of compliance within 30 days per RA 10173.
Responsible (R): Data Protection Officer (DPO)
Accountable (A): Legal Counsel
Duration: 1 day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W271_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W271_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W271_End11" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W271_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W271_Annotation12">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-308 (ensure controlled execution — Government Audit &amp; Inspection Response (PA-22.2).) | - operational: standard operating procedures; system-enforced validation rules
Owner: Data Protection Officer (DPO)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
